{
  "declined": "none",
  "criteria": [
    {
      "id": "task",
      "score": 5,
      "reason": "文章完全回應題目，建議成立一個 cooking club 並說明理由，例如學習生活技能、促進交友與利用學校廚房，符合題目要求。"
    },
    {
      "id": "organization",
      "score": 5,
      "reason": "結構清晰，有開頭 (suggestion)、三個段落分別說明原因 (life skills、making friends、cost)，以及結尾致謝，段落銜接自然。"
    },
    {
      "id": "vocabulary",
      "score": 4,
      "reason": "用詞大多正確且自然，如 \"cooking club\", \"simple and healthy meals\", \"make friends\"，但詞彙深度與多樣性可再增強。"
    },
    {
      "id": "grammar",
      "score": 4,
      "reason": "句子大多正確且易懂，例如 \"we could learn how to make simple and healthy meals.\"，只有少數可改進的小錯誤或更自然的表達。"
    }
  ],
  "issues": [
    {
      "quote": "most students in our school are very busy with studying, and we seldom have time to learn life skills.",
      "type": "grammar",
      "why": "這句子太長且有重複，且片語 \"busy with studying\" 比較不自然，應改為更簡潔的表達。 ",
      "suggestion": "Most students are very busy studying, so we rarely have time to learn life skills."
    },
    {
      "quote": "students would be interested in it and it would help us in many ways.",
      "type": "sentence",
      "why": "這裡出現兩個連續的 'it'，句子可以更緊湊並避免重複代名詞。 ",
      "suggestion": "students would be interested and benefit in many ways."
    },
    {
      "quote": "share their food and talk about their culture.",
      "type": "cohesion",
      "why": "這裡語意正確，但可以更具體說明如何分享與討論文化，讓理由更有說服力。",
      "suggestion": "share dishes and discuss their cultural backgrounds."
    }
  ],
  "more": [
    {
      "quote": "For example, some classmates have parents from Vietnam or Indonesia, and they could teach us dishes from those countries.",
      "type": "word-choice",
      "why": "表達清楚，但可用更自然的片語如 'have parents from' 改為 'are from' 或 'have family origins in'。",
      "suggestion": "For example, some classmates come from Vietnam or Indonesia and could teach us traditional dishes."
    },
    {
      "quote": "Finally, the club would not be expensive, because the school already has a kitchen for home economics class.",
      "type": "grammar",
      "why": "句子正確，但 'not be expensive' 可說得更自然為 'be low-cost' 或 'require little funding'。",
      "suggestion": "Finally, the club would be low-cost because the school already has a home economics kitchen."
    },
    {
      "quote": "I am writing to suggest that our school start a cooking club.",
      "type": "tone",
      "why": "開頭正式且禮貌，但可在開頭加一句概述用以吸引注意，例如一個簡短的好處句。",
      "suggestion": "I am writing to suggest starting a cooking club, which would teach life skills and bring students together."
    }
  ],
  "strengths": [
    {
      "quote": "we could learn how to make simple and healthy meals.",
      "why": "清楚指出具體學習目標，實用且具說服力，貼近學生需要。"
    },
    {
      "quote": "Students from different grades can work together in a team, share their food and talk about their culture.",
      "why": "強調社交與跨年級交流的好處，理由具體且能引起校方重視。"
    }
  ],
  "summary": "文章結構良好、理由明確，接下來可以改善句子流暢度與用詞多樣性。請注意避免代名詞重複與長句冗贅，並練習使用更自然的片語（例如 \"low-cost\" 或 \"come from\"）。繼續把例子寫得更具體，會讓建議更有說服力。"
}
